[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=고속 촬영
Name[en]=High-speed camera
Comment=DVS와 USB 카메라 1초를 1000 fps 슬로모션으로 (둘 다 연결됐을 때만)
Comment[en]=1 s of the DVS and the USB camera as a 1000 fps slow motion (with both connected)
Exec=/usr/local/bin/e850-open hs
Icon=camera-video
Terminal=false
Categories=AudioVideo;Video;
